sentences.t:
Interea extremo bellator in aequore Turnus
palantis sequitur paucos iam segnior atque
iam minus atque minus successu laetus equorum;

sentences.l:
Meanwhile, on the furthest part of the plain, the warrior Turnus
straggling men pursues, a few, now slower, and
now less and less with the success glad of his horses;
